<title>INDONESIA: Sampoerna first-half net edges up.</title>
<headline>Sampoerna first-half net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gross profit			    415.07  vs  322.76</p>
<p>    Operating profit			301.17  vs  239.56</p>
<p>    Net profit				186.40  vs  161.89</p>
<p>    Income before minority interest   185.67  vs  163.00</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	 414  vs     360</p>
<p>    Net sales				 983.29  vs  726.57</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     681.38  vs  428.42</p>
<p>Note : The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Hanjaya Mandala Sampoerna is a cigarette maker.</p>
</text>
